session Continuous_Time_Martingales = "HOL-Probability" +
  description "
    What continuous-time martingale theory needs beyond the AFP's
    Martingales entry: Doob's maximal inequality, optional sampling and
    stopping at a bounded stopping time together with the sigma-algebra of
    events before it, stopping an L2 martingale with continuous paths without
    a domination hypothesis, quadratic variation and its compensator, second
    and fourth moment bounds on martingale increments without stochastic
    integration, Vitali's theorem and the uniform integrability of
    conditional expectations, exit times as stopping times, and the algebra
    of transporting the martingale property along images, products,
    restrictions and modifications -- together with the elementary power
    inequalities every moment estimate runs on and the essential infimum of a
    nonnegative payoff.
  "
  options [document = pdf, document_output = "output"]
  sessions
    Martingales
  theories
    Power_Inequalities
    Essential_Infimum
    Quadratic_Variation
    Time_Discretisation
    Doob_Inequality
    Optional_Sampling
    Stopped_Adaptedness
    Expected_Exit_Times
    Sampled_Martingale
    Sampled_Quadratic_Variation
    Increment_Moments
    Vitali_Convergence
    Conditional_UI
    Modification_Transfer
    Dyadic_Grids
    Stopping_Time_Sampling
    Stopping_Times
    Natural_Filtration
    Semidirect_Kernels
    Martingale_Algebra
    Integrability_Criteria
    Martingale_Transfer
    Stopped_Localization
  document_files
    "root.tex"
    "root.bib"
